  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "10403740-9ee8-4847-aad3-70ffca3768df",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "In here write down your game loops. What does your player do moment by moment?"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c39598c-193a-4535-8c2c-0aa4f226de62",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "Core game loop",
      "anchorId": "core-game-loop"
    },
    {
      "id": "464554b6-0554-4d52-b126-c54794c197ed",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "For example:"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b229df9-1b11-435a-b7e4-013aa263b8d3",
      "type": "columns",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "c9ee9bd1-b036-4c3f-85a1-513e9d1e0b94",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "0ab015c1-e695-48a7-9f8d-11ee663512c0",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Navigate a maze</strong>"
            },
            {
              "id": "6c4aed28-6c53-4e71-84c7-d3ae634875f4",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "The player can move up, down, left or right in a maze."
            },
            {
              "id": "c1a5705c-c55c-49d6-b2ba-4db0dfe25d78",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Avoid ghosts</strong>"
            },
            {
              "id": "586fda27-a5ad-4343-b32c-97b2385b7f8a",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "The player has to avoid ghosts that follow them in the maze."
            },
            {
              "id": "8b54e4c6-17f9-49dd-b965-f780745f4bb0",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Clear the dots in the maze</strong>"
            },
            {
              "id": "5fd292f9-dea7-4bd5-8046-f1fa3c9eab01",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "The player eats dots as they move around the maze."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cd024b5b-e99f-4c1d-add7-e5227845e2fd",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "8cbe52c1-dcc2-4e99-9f9b-511274764d18",
              "type": "image",
              "src": "./assets/images/untitled-drawing-1-faad78116c41.webp",
              "caption": "",
              "alt": "Untitled drawing (1).png"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8e43b3e4-ac3d-4ca1-8591-5e2283b83f74",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "Secondary loops",
      "anchorId": "secondary-loops"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ae8ad22-9b55-4805-9d4e-6455f61ba706",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "If you have any secondary loops add them here."
    },
